title: An Economic Ministry With a Programme
subtitle: Growth is not neutral when the cabinet must choose who receives it.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_government_card
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and ministries_finalized = 1 and economy_minister_party = "Lewica" and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_economic_programme_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_economic_programme_timer = 5
card-image: img/poland/cards/workers-public-services.webp

= An Economic Ministry With a Programme

Employers arrive asking for cheaper labour and faster permits. Trade unions
arrive asking why productivity has never made their members less insecure.
The ministry can turn the argument into investment, a wage compact or a
smaller administrative victory.

[? if left_is_junior_partner = 1: **[+ coalition_senior_partner +] holds the
premiership**, and every conditionality clause passes through its Chancellery.
Objection risk on a contested measure: **[+ coalition_objection_risk +]%**.?]

- @public_investment
- @wage_compact
- @procurement

@public_investment
title: Launch a public investment and industrial programme
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity. Growth comes with institutions and conditions — and the conditions are what get contested.
choose-if: budget >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: The investment programme requires two budget points.
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget -= 2;
const objectionRoll = this.random.uint32() / 4294967296;
const objected =
    Q.left_is_junior_partner &&
    objectionRoll * 100 < Number(Q.coalition_objection_risk) * 1.05;
Q.last_card_objection = objected ? 1 : 0;
Q.last_card_objector = Q.coalition_senior_partner;
if (objected) {
    // The money survives. Public ownership and the collective agreements
    // attached to it do not.
    Q.economic_growth += 0.4;
    Q.unemployment -= 0.2;
    Q.government_delivery += 2;
    Q.fiscal_stress += 2;
    Q.labor_credibility -= 2;
    Q.labor_dissent += 4;
    Q.left_coalition_dissent += 6;
    Q.coalition_blur += 3;
    Q.ministry_overruled_count += 1;
    Q.ministry_overruled_last = "Industrial programme labour conditions";
    Q.news_headline =
        Q.coalition_senior_partner +
        " strips the labour conditions out of the investment programme";
} else {
    Q.economic_growth += 0.8;
    Q.unemployment -= 0.4;
    Q.workers_support += 5;
    Q.industrial_logistics_left_affinity += 3;
    Q.labor_credibility += 3;
    Q.government_delivery += 5;
    Q.administrative_capacity += 1;
    Q.climate_state_capacity += 2;
    Q.climate_policy_pressure = Math.max(0, Q.climate_policy_pressure - 6);
    Q.fiscal_stress += 2;
    if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
        Q.government_coalition_dissent += 5;
        Q.pis_relation -= 3;
    } else {
        Q.ko_coalition_dissent += 4;
    }
    Q.news_headline =
        "The Economy Ministry launches a public investment programme with labour conditions";
}
!}

Rail, energy and regional production receive patient public finance tied to
collective agreements and domestic capacity. [? if government_party != "pis":
KO supports the projects and objects to the part that makes ownership matter.?]
[? if government_party = "pis": PiS supports the domestic production and
objects when trade unions, rather than party-linked boards, receive power over
the conditions.?]

[? if last_card_objection = 1: The programme is announced on schedule with the
conditionality annex removed. What is financed is the same rail and the same
grid; what is not financed is any reason for the workforce building them to
believe this cabinet is different.?]

- #poland_card_finish


@wage_compact
title: Negotiate wages, training and public services together
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. A smaller compact spreads the gains.
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The training and service guarantees require one budget point.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; household_security += 4; labor_credibility += 4; economic_growth += 0.3; inflation += 0.2; government_delivery += 3; ko_coalition_dissent += 2 if government_party != "pis"; government_coalition_dissent += 2 if government_party = "pis"; pis_relation -= 1 if government_party = "pis"; news_headline = "Government, unions and employers sign a wage and training compact"

The agreement trades training support and service guarantees for higher wage
floors and sectoral bargaining. It is less transformative than public
investment, but workers can describe what changed.

- #poland_card_finish


@procurement
title: Rewrite procurement around jobs and delivery
subtitle: Free fallback. Real authority, small reach, and a slower state while contractors relearn the rules.
on-arrival: government_delivery += 2; economic_growth += 0.2; public_trust += 2; labor_credibility += 1; progressives_dissent += 1; administrative_reform_pressure += 3; ko_coalition_dissent += 2 if government_party != "pis"; last_card_objection = 0; news_headline = "Public procurement receives enforceable labour and delivery standards"

The ministry changes scoring rules, publication duties and contract
monitoring. It cannot substitute for an investment budget, but it stops the
state buying low wages and late delivery as though they were bargains.

For two quarters it also stops the state buying much of anything quickly.
Contracting authorities re-tender, the offices absorb the new documentation,
and every delayed project is credited to the ministry that changed the rules.

- #poland_card_finish
